<title>UK: BOE ALLOTS 400 MLN STG IN 7.0 PERCENT REPOS.</title>
<headline>BOE ALLOTS 400 MLN STG IN 7.0 PERCENT REPOS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 400 million stg of assistance at midday in the form of 7.0 percent repos to August 26.</p>
<p>The Bank had allotted 243 million stg in bills and repos in the early round after forecasting a liquidity shortage of 800 million stg.</p>
